# Supplementary USB state feedback for configfs=2 (gadget HAL) mode.
# The build system's init.qcom.usb.rc sets vendor.usb.config and starts
# usbd on sys.usb.config change with configfs=2, but does not set
# sys.usb.state. The framework waits for sys.usb.state to match
# sys.usb.config to complete the state transition. This file provides
# that missing feedback loop.

on property:sys.usb.config=* && property:sys.usb.configfs=2
    setprop sys.usb.state ${sys.usb.config}
